# AI coding-agent instruction files and local env files. They are developer
# context, not application code, and must never land in a published image layer
# (SEC-4364). The COPY apollo/ step would otherwise carry every
# apollo/integrations/*/CLAUDE.md into montecarlodata/agent.
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/.cursorrules
.claude/
.cursor/
.env
.env.*
.envrc
.envrc.*
